# Files Cloudflare does not serve (same syntax as .gitignore). Everything at the top level is left out except the
# page, its icons, manifest and preview image, the interface locales and the regions' data; the build tables stay out.
/*
!/index.html
!/favicon.svg
!/apple-touch-icon.png
!/icon-512.png
!/site.webmanifest
!/og.png
!/locales/
!/regions/
*.py
__pycache__/
/regions/*/sources/
/regions/*/drafts/
